			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize core submodules for API modularization and dependency updates\n\nUpdate the Element submodule to decompose monolithic window namespace factories and refine the UI bridge architecture. In Cocoon, split `Window/Namespace.ts` into distinct PascalCase factory modules (`CreateOutputChannel`, `CreateStatusBarItem`, `CreateTerminal`, `CreateWebviewPanel`) to enforce separation of concerns, implement lazy `processId` resolution, and add React mount safeguards. Refactor Sky's `Bridge.ts` into domain-specific installers (`InstallCommands`, `InstallSimpleRelays`) using dynamic imports to reduce static dependency graphs and activate dormant Mountain-to-Sky event channels.\n\nConcurrently apply upstream dependency patches, upgrading `pnpm/action-setup`, `astro`, `zod`, and `@xterm/xterm` in Output and Sky. Merge `Common`, `Echo`, `Mountain`, `Rest`, `Wind`, and `Worker` to their latest states to ensure the editor benefits from the latest security and performance fixes.\n\nThese changes restore the architectural pattern of dedicated factory modules, enable finer-grained unit testing for UI proxies, and align the codebase with the latest upstream stability updates.",
